<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103865" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τήνα,
		τῆνο</span>, 
			Dor.
		 for 
			Aeol.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῆνος</span>, 
			Ion.
		 and 
			Att.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεῖνος, ἐκεῖνος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>he, she, it,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				4.7
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Aegina</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Epich.
				35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sophr.
				56
			</span></i>, Erinn.in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				9
			</span></i> p.xii, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tab.Heracl.</u>
				1.136
			</span></i>, Ages. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Ages.</u>
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				1.4
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				5
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, etc.: sts. with a strongly demonstr. force, 
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅδε</span>
			 or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδί</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.1
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				23
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>the famous</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.120
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				126
			</span></i>, etc.; or <i>the notorious</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				5.1
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				15
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in
			opposed clauses, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόκα μὲν ἐν τήνων . . , τόκα δὲ πὰρ
					τήνοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epich.
					147
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				1.36
			</span></i>.</div>
